\fs24 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 short description: 
\f1\fs26 \'b1zweihundertsechs is a series of vessels exploring the relationship between fragility, structural strength and the capacity to hold.
\f0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\

\fs24 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 description: 
\f1\fs26 \'b1zweihundertsechs consists of three vessels formed from an open, irregular structure that creates a tension between lightness and stability. The repeated forms leave the surface permeable while maintaining a continuous and resilient construction. Despite their apparent openness, the vessels remain stable and functional, capable of holding objects. Presented individually or in relation to one another, they move between functional container and sculptural form, exploring how structure, material and absence can work together.
